{"data":{"batches":["These items are inside one part of a window in Preview that the person selected.\nItems (number | kind | label | position in the selection | part of window | details):\n1 | button | Adopt | bottom left\n2 | link | More about Biscuit | bottom | goes to /pets/biscuit on this site\n3 | checkbox | Share | bottom right | off\n4 | picture | Picture | left | looks like: a ball\n5 | picture | Image | center\n6 | picture | Photo | right | looks like: a dog, grass\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Say what each one is for within this selection and why someone would use it. For a text item, say in plain words what the text says and what it means for the person; do not just read it back. For a picture, say what it shows using its details, for example “This is a photo of a dog.” Do not describe the rest of the window, the app or the website. Never just repeat the label.","These items are inside one part of a window in Preview that the person selected.\nItems (number | kind | label | position in the selection | part of window | details):\n1 | text | Meet Biscuit | top\n2 | text | Biscuit is a friendly two year old terrier mix. She loves long walks and naps in the sun. | top\n3 | text | Photo taken at the shelter | bottom right\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Say what each one is for within this selection and why someone would use it. For a text item, say in plain words what the text says and what it means for the person; do not just read it back. For a picture, say what it shows using its details, for example “This is a photo of a dog.” Do not describe the rest of the window, the app or the website. Never just repeat the label."],"cached":false,"prompt":"The person selected one part of a window in Preview.\nItems inside the selection (number | kind | label | position in the selection | part of window | details):\n0 | heading | Meet Biscuit | top\n1 | visible text | Meet Biscuit | top\n2 | visible text | • | top left\n3 | visible text | Biscuit is a friendly two year old | top left\n4 | visible text | She loves long walks and naps | top\n5 | visible text | terrier mix. | top\n6 | visible text | in the sun. | left\n7 | picture | Picture | left | looks like: a ball\n8 | picture | Image | center\n9 | picture | Photo | right | looks like: a dog, grass\n10 | visible text | Photo taken at the shelter | bottom right\n11 | visible text | Adopt | bottom left\n12 | button | Adopt | bottom left\n13 | link | More about Biscuit | bottom | goes to /pets/biscuit on this site\n14 | checkbox | Share | bottom right | off\nDescribe only what is inside the selection: what it is, what it shows or says, and what someone can do with it. Do not describe the rest of the window, the app, or the website as a whole. The visible text items are read from a picture of the selection. The picture in the selection looks like it contains: a dog on grass.","request":"a1"},"ok":true}
